# BDPAYHUB — FINAL MASTER PROMPT
## Complete Android Application Development

**Role:** Senior Android Architect, Kotlin Engineer, Mobile Security Engineer & UI/UX Designer  
**Project:** BDPayHub — Payment Verification & Reconciliation Infrastructure  
**Platform:** Native Android  
**Primary Language:** Kotlin  
